{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Resonance Tales: Alone</strong> is a <strong>first-person psychological horror experience</strong> centered around <strong>atmosphere, tension, and introspective storytelling</strong>. You don\u2019t fight to survive \u2014 you move to understand. Step into a symbolic, dreamlike space where reality blurs with memory and fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Just fragments of a story told through shadows, rooms, and the way you move through them. You\u2019re not solving puzzles \u2014 you\u2019re piecing yourself together.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >First-person exploration with a psychological edge</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized 3D visuals with surreal and haunting spaces</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative told through environments, not exposition</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Subtle mechanics, heavy atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every detail has weight \u2014 even silence</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It won\u2019t tell you what\u2019s happening. But it\u2019ll make you <i>feel</i> it.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772400?t=1750337906","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3772400?t=1750337906","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772400/23f091ddb4cad81c3b7888bebf5a47a1398c0363/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750337906","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3772400/23f091ddb4cad81c3b7888bebf5a47a1398c0363/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750337906","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game includes mature psychological themes, frightening scenes, and depictions of trauma. Players may encounter unset